chapter.name=First steps
quest.choose-your-weapon.title=Choose your weapon
quest.choose-your-weapon.description=One of the four. The others can wait.
quest.choose-your-weapon.short=Craft one of the four crude weapons
quest.choose-your-weapon.craft-sword.title=Craft a crude sword
quest.choose-your-weapon.craft-sword.description=The straightforward answer.
quest.choose-your-weapon.craft-daggers.title=Craft crude daggers
quest.choose-your-weapon.craft-daggers.description=Two blades for whoever would rather be quick.
quest.choose-your-weapon.craft-mace.title=Craft a crude mace
quest.choose-your-weapon.craft-mace.description=Nothing subtle about it.
quest.choose-your-weapon.craft-battleaxe.title=Craft a crude battleaxe
quest.choose-your-weapon.craft-battleaxe.description=Slow, and worth the wait.
quest.craft-tools.title=Craft a hatchet and pickaxe
quest.craft-tools.description=Two tools, and the world opens up.
quest.craft-tools.short=Craft a crude hatchet and a crude pickaxe
quest.craft-tools.hatchet.title=Craft a crude hatchet
quest.craft-tools.hatchet.description=Sticks and stone make an edge good enough for wood.
quest.craft-tools.pickaxe.title=Craft a crude pickaxe
quest.craft-tools.pickaxe.description=The same again, shaped for rock.
quest.craft-workbench.title=Craft a workbench
quest.craft-workbench.description=Every camp worth the name has a bench at its heart.
quest.craft-workbench.short=Gather wood and stone, then craft and place a workbench
quest.craft-workbench.break-wood.title=Break some wood
quest.craft-workbench.break-wood.description=Use your hatchet to cut trunks.
quest.craft-workbench.break-stone.title=Break some stone
quest.craft-workbench.break-stone.description=Use your pickaxe to break rocks.
quest.craft-workbench.gather-wood.title=Gather wood
quest.craft-workbench.gather-wood.description=Four pieces, carried rather than left where they fell.
quest.craft-workbench.gather-stone.title=Gather stone
quest.craft-workbench.gather-stone.description=Three pieces will do for the bench.
quest.craft-workbench.bench.title=Craft the workbench
quest.craft-workbench.bench.description=Put the wood and the stone together.
quest.craft-workbench.place-bench.title=Put the workbench down
quest.craft-workbench.place-bench.description=A bench in your pack is no use to anyone.
quest.intro.title=Introduction
quest.intro.description=Take your first steps, and gather what a first camp is built from.
quest.intro.short=Gather rubble, plant fiber and sticks
quest.intro.gather-stick.title=Gather sticks
quest.intro.gather-stick.description=Pick up sticks from the ground and from bushes.
quest.intro.gather-fibre.title=Gather plant fiber
quest.intro.gather-fibre.description=Pull plant fiber from the tall grass around you.
quest.intro.gather-rubble.title=Gather stone rubble
quest.intro.gather-rubble.description=Break rocks to collect stone rubble.
quest.skip-intro.title=Skip Intro
quest.skip-intro.description=Already know your way around? Nobody will hold it against you.
quest.skip-intro.short=Use /ojournal or /oquest abandon Intro to skip the tutorial
